'''Nostalgia''' (ノスタルジー, ''Nosutarujī'', '''Nostalgia''') was a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack Up (M): Cats' attack power increases by 15%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Nostalgia|Unit Attack Up (M)|Tin Cat|Pogo Cat|Hoop Cat|Stilts Cat|Flower Cat|jpname=ノスタルジー|link=}}
}}

==Trivia==
*[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]] was in this [[Cat Combo|Combo]] because his flower is based on an old toy: the [[wikipedia:ja:フラワーロック|FLOWER ROCK]], a toy potted flower first released by Tomy in 1988. The toy would "[https://youtu.be/o4Cr5XRsI24 dance]" in response to sound such as clapping, just like in Flower Cat's attack animation.

